@startuml 09_Sequence_Problem_Submission
title Problem Submission & Image Upload - Sequence Diagram

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor DarkSlateGray
    ActorBorderColor DarkSlateGray
    LifeLineBorderColor DarkSlateGray
    ParticipantBorderColor DarkSlateGray
    ParticipantBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
}

actor User
participant "CameraScreen\n(React Native)" as Camera
participant "ImageCompressionSvc\n(Frontend)" as ImgSvc
participant "problemSlice\n(Redux)" as Redux
participant "ProblemService\n(Frontend)" as ProblemSvc
participant "ApiClient\n(Axios)" as ApiClient
participant "ProblemController\n(.NET)" as Controller
participant "CreateProblemHandler\n(.NET)" as CreateHandler
participant "UploadImageHandler\n(.NET)" as UploadHandler
participant "ProblemRepository\n(EF Core)" as Repo
database "MySQL\n(Problem DB)" as DB
participant "File Storage\n(.NET)" as Storage
participant "MLServiceClient\n(.NET)" as MLClient
participant "OCR Service\n(FastAPI)" as OCRSvc

== Step 1: Capture Image ==

User -> Camera : Tap "Take Photo" or "Gallery"
Camera -> Camera : expo-camera.takePictureAsync()\nor expo-image-picker.launchImageLibraryAsync()
Camera --> User : Show preview

User -> Camera : Confirm image

Camera -> ImgSvc : checkImageQuality(imageUri)
activate ImgSvc
ImgSvc -> ImgSvc : Analyze brightness, blur, resolution
ImgSvc --> Camera : QualityScore (0-100)
deactivate ImgSvc

alt Quality < 50
    Camera --> User : Show quality warning\n"Image may be unclear"
    User -> Camera : Re-take or proceed anyway
end

Camera -> ImgSvc : compressImage(imageUri, {quality: 0.7})
activate ImgSvc
ImgSvc -> ImgSvc : Resize to max 1920px\nJPEG compress (60-80% reduction)
ImgSvc --> Camera : CompressedImageUri + size
deactivate ImgSvc

== Step 2: Create Problem Record ==

User -> Camera : Select category, difficulty
User -> Camera : Tap "Submit"

Camera -> Redux : dispatch(createProblem({title, category, difficulty}))
activate Redux

Redux -> ProblemSvc : createProblem(data)
activate ProblemSvc

ProblemSvc -> ApiClient : POST /api/v1/problems\n{title, description?, category, difficulty}\n+ Authorization: Bearer {token}
activate ApiClient

ApiClient -> Controller : HTTP POST /api/v1/problems
activate Controller

Controller -> CreateHandler : Send(CreateProblemCommand)
activate CreateHandler

CreateHandler -> Repo : AddAsync(problem)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB : INSERT INTO Problems\n{id, userId, title, category, difficulty,\nstatus=Pending, createdAt}
DB --> Repo : OK
Repo --> CreateHandler : Saved
deactivate Repo

CreateHandler --> Controller : ProblemDto {id, status="Pending", ...}
deactivate CreateHandler

Controller --> ApiClient : 201 Created\n{problem}
deactivate Controller

ApiClient --> ProblemSvc : Problem
deactivate ApiClient
ProblemSvc --> Redux : Problem
deactivate ProblemSvc

Redux -> Redux : problems.push(problem)
Redux --> Camera : problem.id available
deactivate Redux

== Step 3: Upload Image ==

Camera -> Redux : dispatch(uploadImage({problemId, imageData}))
activate Redux

Redux -> ProblemSvc : uploadImage(problemId, formData)
activate ProblemSvc

ProblemSvc -> ApiClient : POST /api/v1/problems/{id}/upload\nContent-Type: multipart/form-data\n{file: compressedImage}
activate ApiClient

ApiClient -> Controller : HTTP POST /api/v1/problems/{id}/upload
activate Controller

Controller -> UploadHandler : Send(UploadImageCommand)
activate UploadHandler

UploadHandler -> Storage : SaveFileAsync(imageBytes, fileName)
activate Storage
Storage --> UploadHandler : imagePath (disk/cloud path)
deactivate Storage

UploadHandler -> Repo : GetByIdAsync(problemId)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB : SELECT * FROM Problems WHERE Id=?
DB --> Repo : Problem entity
deactivate Repo

UploadHandler -> UploadHandler : problem.SetImage(imagePath)
UploadHandler -> UploadHandler : problem.SetProcessing()

UploadHandler -> Repo : UpdateAsync(problem)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB : UPDATE Problems SET\nImagePath=?, Status=Processing
DB --> Repo : OK
deactivate Repo

UploadHandler -> MLClient : ExtractTextAsync(imageBytes, imageUrl)
activate MLClient

MLClient -> OCRSvc : POST /api/v1/ocr/extract\n{image: base64/bytes, problemId}
activate OCRSvc
note over OCRSvc : Background task:\n1. Preprocess image\n2. TrOCR inference\n3. Post-process text

OCRSvc --> MLClient : 202 Accepted\n{taskId, status="QUEUED"}
deactivate OCRSvc
MLClient --> UploadHandler : Task initiated (async)
deactivate MLClient

UploadHandler --> Controller : ProblemDto {status="Processing"}
deactivate UploadHandler

Controller --> ApiClient : 200 OK\n{problem with status=Processing}
deactivate Controller

ApiClient --> ProblemSvc : Updated Problem
deactivate ApiClient
ProblemSvc --> Redux : Problem (status=Processing)
deactivate ProblemSvc

Redux -> Redux : Update problem in state
Redux --> Camera : Navigate to SolutionScreen\n(show "Processing..." state)
deactivate Redux

Camera --> User : Show processing indicator

@enduml
